<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Precision Indian Railways Scale Models</title>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 50px 0; }
        h1 { color: #d4af37; } /* Gold/Brass color */
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .card { background: #2a2a2a; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #d4af37; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; background: #d4af37; color: #000; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Precision Indian Railways Scale Models</h1>
        <p>Handcrafted, full-brass G-Scale masterworks running real-time telemetry and dual-processor architecture.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn">Explore the Prototype</a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>Pure Brass Craftsmanship</h3><p>Heavy-gauge brass body panels, custom CNC-machined gears, and authentic scaling.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Advanced Dual-Processor Stack</h3><p>Powered by an industrial processor and ESP32 parallel stack running real-time telemetry.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Extreme Speed Limits</h3><p>Engineered around a real overhead catenary track-power system.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div id="contact" style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <h2>Contact for Commissions</h2>
        <form action="mailto:your-email@example.com" method="post">
            <textarea placeholder="Your inquiry about models..." style="width: 100%; height: 100px;"></textarea><br>
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Send Request</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
